  "bio": "Nestled in the vibrant heart of downtown Portland, Murder Ink is a renowned tattoo collective boasting an eclectic team of 9 artists who masterfully ink in dotwork, sketch, and realism styles. With experience ranging from 2 to 26 years and a welcoming studio atmosphere, they cater to both pre-scheduled appointments and spontaneous walk-ins from Monday to Sunday, 12-10pm. Step into their creative realm to transcend into a world of art and expression.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Portland, Oregon, United States\n\nTattoo Collective in the heart of downtown Portland\n👤9 Artists\n💉2-26 years experience\n⏱Monday-Sunday 12-10pm\n📞Call for appointment or walk in, today!",
